      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'm just a bit worried about the students getting confused by the term 'living tree' vs 'textualism'—it feels like those are loaded terms. could you explain if there's an actual consensus among legal scholars on which approach is more 'correct' or legally sound? like, is one of these just a way to avoid following the actual text of the constitution?",
